 pfwd  devbo+------------------------------------------------------+on   ? help
------------| Keys                                                 |------------
  STATE   RE|                                                      |FFIC
> * fwd   :5| up down  j k move                                    |K/s ^1.0K/s
  o pause :8| g G          first, last                             |
  * fwd   :8| enter  f     forward the port, or stop it            |^0
  ----------| F            forward to another local port           |----------
  -       :6| x            stop the forward                        |
  -       :9| o            open in the browser                     |
            | y            copy the URL                            |
            | p            pin: remember the forward next time     |
            | a            turn auto-forward on or off             |
            | /            filter by port, process or label        |
            | h            show or hide ignored ports              |
            | L            event log                               |
            | tab          next host; shift+tab the one before     |
            | ctrl+a       all hosts in one table, or back         |
            | +            connect another host                    |
            | r            expose a local port on the server       |
            | d            start or stop a SOCKS proxy (1080)      |
            | c            reconnect now                           |
- 1 ignored | x            stop retrying, while reconnecting       |------------
 + Forwarded| up down more keys, 1-19 of 21                        |
 enter stop +------------------------------------------------------+ q quit
